flowchart TD
    A[Create rg-lab02-cam] --> B[Create vnet-lab02 + snet-web]
    B --> C[Create snet-db]
    C --> D[Create AzureBastionSubnet]
    D --> E[Create NAT Gateway on snet-db]
    E --> F[Create vm-db-01: no public IP, no NSG rule]
    F --> G{Private IP == 10.0.2.4?}
    G -->|no| G1[Fix DB_HOST in cloud-init-web.yaml]
    G -->|yes| H[Create vm-web-01: public IP]
    G1 --> H
    H --> I[Open port 80 on vm-web-01]
    I --> J[Create NSG rule Allow-Web-To-SQL: 1433 from snet-web only]
    J --> K[Create Bastion bastion-lab02]
    K --> L{/healthz check}
    L -->|db-unreachable 503| L1[Wait: SQL Server still installing]
    L1 --> L
    L -->|ok 200| M[Prove it: shorten a URL, click, redirect from dbo.links]
    M --> N[Prove privacy: nc -vz 10.0.2.4 1433 from laptop]
    N --> O{Route exists?}
    O -->|yes, unexpected| O1[Investigate NSG / public-IP misconfig]
    O -->|no, expected| P[Isolation confirmed: no public IP + NSG deny]
    P --> Q[Teardown: az group delete rg-lab02-cam]

